# Goal: Run Ecommerce Application

The goal is to start both the Spring Boot backend and the React frontend.

## Proposed Changes

### [Component Name] Backend

- Run Maven command to start Spring Boot app.
- Command: `mvn spring-boot:run` in `/Users/david/antigravity/backend`.

### [Component Name] Frontend

- Run Vite command to start development server.
- Command: `npm run dev` in `/Users/david/antigravity/frontend`.

## Verification Plan

### Manual Verification
- Check if backend is running on `http://localhost:8080`.
- Check if frontend is running on `http://localhost:5173`.
